{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, farm, hunt, explore and fight to survive on lush procedural islands in Hexiv!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use cards to move, attack, provide tasks for your crew, expand your territory,  and construct buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore ruins and purchase upgrades in the Research Lab to acquire artifacts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Refuel your Lander and hop to new islands, journeying towards the final showdown at the planet's equator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.poster.avif?t=1772473614\" aria-label=\"A wheat card is dragged onto a tile and placed. Smoke rises from the chimney of a building on a nearby tile and wind blows softly across pixelated crop fields and forests.\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.webm?t=1772473614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.mp4?t=1772473614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful and dynamic pixel perfect pixel art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Chapters with customizable difficulty modifiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural islands with different biome, wildlife, and varied topography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Artifacts which grant unique game modifiers and can be permanently upgraded by completing their achievement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ upgradeable cards you can buy from the Trader or acquire from other actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen unique crew you can unlock, each with their own passives and quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 landers with unique game mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research Laboratory where you can spend Research to purchase Artifacts and other upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy tiles and units intent on stopping you and terraforming the planet into a frozen wasteland!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.poster.avif?t=1772473614\" aria-label=\"Wind turbines spin on the beach while detailed pixelated water laps against the shore.\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.webm?t=1772473614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.mp4?t=1772473614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the Developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by my passion for strategy, deckbuilding, and board games, Hexiv is a labor of love painstakingly crafted, tested, and iterated on for over 6 years. Hexiv is born my nostalgia for 90's gaming fused with modern design and presented in timeless,  pixeled fidelity. I hope you have as much fun playing Hexiv as I did in making it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Graeme Little</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2485820?t=1772473614","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772473614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/f446d7768faf2c7028fbe816553b6b9240f9a38d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772473614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/f446d7768faf2c7028fbe816553b6b9240f9a38d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772473614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, farm, hunt, explore and fight to survive on lush procedural islands in Hexiv!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use cards to move, attack, provide tasks for your crew, expand your territory,  and construct buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore ruins and purchase upgrades in the Research Lab to acquire artifacts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Refuel your Lander and hop to new islands, journeying towards the final showdown at the planet's equator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.poster.avif?t=1772473614\" aria-label=\"A wheat card is dragged onto a tile and placed. Smoke rises from the chimney of a building on a nearby tile and wind blows softly across pixelated crop fields and forests.\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.webm?t=1772473614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/85e34ad6f94d12133f607bd2b7fcde4b.mp4?t=1772473614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful and dynamic pixel perfect pixel art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Chapters with customizable difficulty modifiers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural islands with different biome, wildlife, and varied topography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Artifacts which grant unique game modifiers and can be permanently upgraded by completing their achievement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ upgradeable cards you can buy from the Trader or acquire from other actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen unique crew you can unlock, each with their own passives and quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 landers with unique game mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research Laboratory where you can spend Research to purchase Artifacts and other upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy tiles and units intent on stopping you and terraforming the planet into a frozen wasteland!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.poster.avif?t=1772473614\" aria-label=\"Wind turbines spin on the beach while detailed pixelated water laps against the shore.\" width=616 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.webm?t=1772473614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/extras/28376bb115d7fdd04feff2778df4ca12.mp4?t=1772473614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the Developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by my passion for strategy, deckbuilding, and board games, Hexiv is a labor of love painstakingly crafted, tested, and iterated on for over 6 years. Hexiv is born my nostalgia for 90's gaming fused with modern design and presented in timeless,  pixeled fidelity. I hope you have as much fun playing Hexiv as I did in making it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Graeme Little</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Graeme Little"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/ca1e60e11a32b46e931e69167e8ff240491c3e24/header.jpg?t=1772473614","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Hexiv","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Runs well (90fps on OLED) Steam Deck so it should run well on most systems!</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Graeme Little"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cI can tell you right now this game is good! It's a very fun game and it feels very much like a board game. I've relearned and played it three times now and I enjoyed every single time. Highly recommended, it's really cool.\u201d<br>Edmund McMillen (Mewgenics, The Binding of Isaac, The End Is Nigh, etc.)<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/3c144c8b69c9dd70a7413d61806b972833b8e6f3/ss_3c144c8b69c9dd70a7413d61806b972833b8e6f3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772473614","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/3c144c8b69c9dd70a7413d61806b972833b8e6f3/ss_3c144c8b69c9dd70a7413d61806b972833b8e6f3.600x338.jpg?t=1772473614"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/b0b61f70cc39c481dfea2ec32e77c0727eb8358c/ss_b0b61f70cc39c481dfea2ec32e77c0727eb8358c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772473614","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/b0b61f70cc39c481dfea2ec32e77c0727eb8358c/ss_b0b61f70cc39c481dfea2ec32e77c0727eb8358c.600x338.jpg?t=1772473614"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/272d13850612a0512d81b35e3390a69a2c406f57/ss_272d13850612a0512d81b35e3390a69a2c406f57.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772473614","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/272d13850612a0512d81b35e3390a69a2c406f57/ss_272d13850612a0512d81b35e3390a69a2c406f57.600x338.jpg?t=1772473614"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/11a9095cbc9bf857149d388d5392eec35d48b11e/ss_11a9095cbc9bf857149d388d5392eec35d48b11e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772473614","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/11a9095cbc9bf857149d388d5392eec35d48b11e/ss_11a9095cbc9bf857149d388d5392eec35d48b11e.600x338.jpg?t=1772473614"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/6350a12c874e1787bf9f868d67d90aaedfad964a/ss_6350a12c874e1787bf9f868d67d90aaedfad964a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772473614","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/6350a12c874e1787bf9f868d67d90aaedfad964a/ss_6350a12c874e1787bf9f868d67d90aaedfad964a.600x338.jpg?t=1772473614"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/e4df2a73a644b4fdb3b97a0a68c2d1f6b89fecad/ss_e4df2a73a644b4fdb3b97a0a68c2d1f6b89fecad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772473614","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/e4df2a73a644b4fdb3b97a0a68c2d1f6b89fecad/ss_e4df2a73a644b4fdb3b97a0a68c2d1f6b89fecad.600x338.jpg?t=1772473614"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/49100f119fcf6303c860887297434c3528d253ba/ss_49100f119fcf6303c860887297434c3528d253ba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772473614","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/49100f119fcf6303c860887297434c3528d253ba/ss_49100f119fcf6303c860887297434c3528d253ba.600x338.jpg?t=1772473614"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/9809ac5fd46b34ba71a608c99be748ac4a063748/ss_9809ac5fd46b34ba71a608c99be748ac4a063748.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772473614","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485820/9809ac5fd46b34ba71a608c99be748ac4a063748/ss_9809ac5fd46b34ba71a608c99be748ac4a063748.600x338.jpg?t=1772473614"}],"short_description":"Hexiv is a strategy deckbuilder about surviving on a lush but hostile planet. Use cards to build, explore and feed your crew while battling a determined adversary to unlock the mysteries of this genre-blending roguelike!","steam_appid":2485820,"support_info":{"email":"hexiv@graemelittle.com","url":"https://discord.hexivgame.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}